___________________________________| HELP |_________________________________
| To Select: Use the arrow keys to make selections from the menus.          |
|            - Up and Down arrow, scroll menus and windows up and down.     |
|            - Right arrow, puts the current selection on the command line. |
|            - Left arrow:                                                  |
|               In the Actions menu, will select the Event window, to allow |
|                  back scrolling.                                          |
|               In other menus, will inactivate that menu, removing the     |
|                  last selection from the command line.                    |
|                                                                           |
| To Redraw: ^R or ^L Will refresh the screen.                              |
|                                                                           |
| To Move:   Note, the Cardinal ^S freezes some systems (^Q will resume)    |
|          ROSETTE                                        CARDINAL          |
|           North                                           North           |
|            ^T                                              ^N             |
|             |                   ^U - Up                     |             |
|    West ^F -+- ^G  East                            West ^W -+- ^E East    |
|             |                   ^D - Down                   |             |
|            ^V                                              ^V             |
|           South                                           South           |
|                                                                           |
|[ Need more help? Call 206.772.6922 US, Voice]_[ TO EXIT, Type [SPACE] ^R ]|
